Package: porelo-message-sluice-filter
Version: [[sluice.package.version]]
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: porelo, libc6 (>= [[sluice.glibc.floor]]), zlib1g (>= 1:[[sluice.zlib.floor]])
Maintainer: Michael Schnell <michael@fuin.org>
Homepage: https://github.com/porelo-ai/porelo-message-sluice
Description: Refuses an outgoing agent message that carries data
 The filter Porelo runs over every message a task sends: only plain English prose passes.
 Encoded payloads, credentials and personal data are refused, and the task is told why.
